#Frontend Implementation Guidelines

## Layout Structure
- Base resolution: 1920x1080px
- Responsive design principles should be applied
- Single page application with card-based interface
- Background: Subtle gradient or neutral color (recommend #f8f9fa to #ffffff)

## Animation Guidelines
- Use CSS transitions for smooth animations (300-400ms duration)
- Ease-in-out timing function for natural movement
- Add subtle scale effect when transitioning between stages
- Consider using framer-motion for more complex animations

## State Management
- Track current view state
- Components will likely use the same state management system as the rest of the app ""
- Cache recent data to improve performance

## Accessibility
- Maintain contrast ratios of at least 4.5:1 for text
- Ensure keyboard navigability between all interactive elements
- Include ARIA labels for dynamic content
- Support screen readers for all important information

## Responsive Considerations
- On smaller screens, adjust card dimensions proportionally
- For mobile, consider a different transition pattern (e.g., slide from right)
- Maintain tap target sizes of at least 44x44px for touch devices